    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.05,
      "end_seconds": 15.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.72,
      "end_seconds": 26.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "Well, I've been having swollen glands. I wasn't sure whether to to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.55,
      "end_seconds": 32.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.82,
      "end_seconds": 36.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "uh, for three weeks, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.44,
      "end_seconds": 40.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.08,
      "end_seconds": 46.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight you know out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.23,
      "end_seconds": 49.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.98,
      "end_seconds": 63.26,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "when it it starts I tend to get a widespread rash with fever as well the widespread rash with fever? That's been for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.63,
      "end_seconds": 66.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.71,
      "end_seconds": 72.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.32,
      "end_seconds": 77.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.11,
      "end_seconds": 81.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.61,
      "end_seconds": 87.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.78,
      "end_seconds": 97.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed i'm on allopurinol, 300 milligrams, started four weeks ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.28,
      "end_seconds": 112.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.5,
      "end_seconds": 118.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I have eczema for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.37,
      "end_seconds": 127.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.47,
      "end_seconds": 130.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.68,
      "end_seconds": 136.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "a few quick ones: breathing difficulty, blisters or mouth sores?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.04,
      "end_seconds": 143.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "No you know no breathing difficulty blisters or mouth sores."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.02,
      "end_seconds": 146.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "How are your bowels any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.8,
      "end_seconds": 150.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.99,
      "end_seconds": 172.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.83,
      "end_seconds": 185.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.84,
      "end_seconds": 210.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "okay: temp 38.9 degrees pressure 113 over 69. And respiratory rate 20 SpO2 95 percent on room air pulse 103."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.98,
      "end_seconds": 215.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.81,
      "end_seconds": 220.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.04,
      "end_seconds": 227.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.73,
      "end_seconds": 243.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.54,
      "end_seconds": 245.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.02,
      "end_seconds": 262.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "there is a widespread red rash, facial swelling, and your temperature is high with enlarged glands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.72,
      "end_seconds": 268.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "all finished, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.78,
      "end_seconds": 289.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, my working impression is a severe drug reaction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.97,
      "end_seconds": 293.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Mm, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.92,
      "end_seconds": 308.06,
      "duration_seconds": 13.14,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to to an emergency. It looks like a severe drug reaction but I'd like to confirm. I'm sending you for urgent blood tests cos of severe drug reaction"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.92,
      "end_seconds": 315.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.24,
      "end_seconds": 348.78,
      "duration_seconds": 32.54,
      "text": "I'm prescribing prednisolone 40 milligrams once a day until review that's for severe drug reaction stop the allopurinol now and you need admission avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us keep an eye out and if the symptoms get worse call us the same day or go to emergency that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.87,
      "end_seconds": 354.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "right I'll do that thank you doctor"
    }
  ]
